    "media:imagetext": "TWA\nEMPLOYEES' TIMETABLE\nINTERNATIONAL SCHEDULES\nISSUE DATE JANUARY 31, 1975\nTransmittal 3-75\nEFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 23, 1975\n(Except as Noted)\nTRANS WORLD\nolidays'75\nTWA's Exclusive Holidays '75 Program is designed for independent leisure\ntravellers - - and is fully commissionable at 10% to travel agents. Remind\nyour agents of this valuable program and its commissions.\nHolidays USA (10% Commissionable to Agents)\nThis new tour book offers exciting ways to see the U.S.A. Freestyle Tours\nin 10 great cities. Freewheeler West and East. Motorcoach Tours.\nCanyonlands. TrekAmerica Tours. Dude Ranch Holidays. All backed\nby TWA's Tour Warranty.\nHotelpass USA/Canada (10% Commissionable to Agents)\nGuaranteed accommodations without reservations in 30 cities. Room rates\nstart at a low U.S. $8. 75 per person. Choice of three hotel categories.\nLittle Black Book\nA TWA extra for 17 worldwide cities. It's packed with coupons good for\ndiscounts and savings on meals, beverages, admissions, and merchandise.\nGetaway Guides\nAuthoritative and lively, they give valuable information on the sights to see,\nplaces to go, and off beat attractions only a local resident would know.\nThere are 15 Guides available, at U.S. $1.50 each.\nFEBRUARY 1975\nSu Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa\n16\n23\n3\n10\n17\n24\n11\n18\n25\n5\n12\n19\n26\n6\n13\n20\n27\n7\n14\n21\n28\n8\n15\n22\nTWA FORM T211-1-75\n2004. 104.140\nMARCH 1975\nSu Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\n4\n11\n18\n25\n5\n6\n12\n13\n19\n20\n26 27\n7\n14\n21\n28\n15\n22\n29\nAPRIL 1975\nSu Mo\nTu We Th\nFr Sa\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n13\n20\n27\n7\n14\n21\n28\n8\n9\n10\n11\n12\n15\n16\n17\n18\n19\n22\n23\n24\n25\n26\n29\n30\nMAY 1975\nSu Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa\n1\n8\n11\n18\n25\n12\n19\n26\n13\n20\n27\n14\n21\n28\n15\n22\n29\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\nPrinted in U.S.A.",
